extends ../layouts/main
block content
  section.page-hero
    .container
      span.eyebrow Academics
      h1 Strong foundations for lifelong learning
      p We focus on literacy, numeracy, academic support and practical learning.
  section.py-5
    .container
      .row.g-4
        .col-lg-4: .info-card
          h2 Reading & literacy
          p Supporting learners to read with confidence, understand what they read and communicate clearly.
        .col-lg-4: .info-card
          h2 Mathematics
          p Building number sense, problem-solving skills and confidence in applying mathematics.
        .col-lg-4: .info-card
          h2 Practical learning
          p Connecting classroom ideas to real-life situations, peer learning and co-curricular activities.
      .section-soft.rounded-4.p-4.p-lg-5.mt-5
        h2 Learning and teaching together
        p.mb-0 Teachers plan, learn from one another and reflect on classroom practice. The school also encourages parents to support learning and positive development at home.
